<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech stats bureau details 1997 sowing areas.</title>
<headline>Czech stats bureau details 1997 sowing areas.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) on Wednesday released the following 1997 season agricultural sowing area figures:</p>
<p> COMMODITY	   1997	  1996	   INDEX</p>
<p>			   (in hectares)	  (pct change)</p>
<p> Winter wheat	773,909    756,484	 102.3</p>
<p> Spring wheat	 60,228     44,855	 134.3</p>
<p> Rye		    75,740     64,088	 118.2</p>
<p> Winter barley     158,118    153,747	 102.8</p>
<p> Spring barley     495,333    450,382	 110.0</p>
<p> Sugar beet	   94,498    104,115	  90.8</p>
<p> Rape seed	   229,767    228,775	 100.4</p>
<p> Corn		   34,985     29,877	 117.1</p>
<p> Maize		 269,213    304,129	  88.5</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
